{
  "summary": "This experiment tested switching the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 in the multiprofile/avgpool setup (config_002), which previously showed moderate performance. Validation accuracy (0.6501) and F1 (0.6275) are higher than config_002, suggesting the scvi_n200 encoder may contribute to improved performance. However, the exact contribution of the RNA encoder complexity versus other design factors remains uncertain without direct comparison to alternative encoders or additional experimental controls."
}

